        "other_generation_parameters": "unchanged public Space defaults",
        "reference_sha256": "78de4bd45743554f15ce32d8db39deaf1c0b1a9a5cd69fabb6d637dff323ed1c",
        "transcript_sha256": "46de9b48af8de666aa7275169f1f95fab8a398de3198c7d2fa51edbe22fb8451"
      },
      "fingerprint": "90fe7f039d30c7fb6f83ad5550e447d50ea724a2ffcb2973c4be112166d310c2",
      "status": "pending",
      "attempts": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s007",
      "title": "Check the actual gap",
      "text": "Now look at the problem the budget needs to solve. If your essential bills exceed your income, a coffee calculation does not make the larger gap disappear. Start with housing, transport, debt payments, and other commitments you can realistically change. Some costs are difficult to move quickly. This is not a reason to blame yourself. It is a reason to match the action to the problem.",
      "settings": {
        "space": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS",
        "endpoint": "/generate_voice_clone",
        "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base",
        "model_size": "1.7B",
        "language": "English",
        "use_xvector_only": true,
        "reference": "Audio/ren_reference.wav",
        "transcript": "Audio/ren_reference.txt",
        "other_generation_parameters": "unchanged public Space defaults",
        "reference_sha256": "78de4bd45743554f15ce32d8db39deaf1c0b1a9a5cd69fabb6d637dff323ed1c",
        "transcript_sha256": "46de9b48af8de666aa7275169f1f95fab8a398de3198c7d2fa51edbe22fb8451"
      },
      "fingerprint": "51a136fcd0dcd18c19496fc0fb342f14985e94662875e5cc80c955bbe90ac4b8",
      "status": "pending",
      "attempts": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s008",
      "title": "Keep the wider view",
      "text": "Small purchases still matter when they add up or crowd out something more important. But so can a recurring charge you no longer use, an avoidable fee, or a larger commitment that no longer fits your life. Compare actual dollars, practical effort, and personal value. Do not assume the cheapest pleasure is the first thing that deserves to go. Review the whole picture.",
      "settings": {
        "space": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS",
        "endpoint": "/generate_voice_clone",
        "model": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base",
        "model_size": "1.7B",
