    {
      "id": "s009",
      "title": "A middle option",
      "text": "You also have more than two choices. Keep the coffee every day, make it at home, choose a less expensive order, or buy it on the days you enjoy it most. For another illustration, skipping two four dollar purchases a week for fifty two weeks frees four hundred and sixteen dollars before replacement costs. That is a choice to consider, not a rule to obey.",
      "settings": {
