    {
      "id": "s010",
      "title": "Name the alternative",
      "text": "Give any money you release a job. Otherwise, the sacrifice can feel real while the benefit stays invisible. You might transfer the difference into a separate savings pot after each week, or put it towards a specific bill. Choose a destination that matters to you. This does not guarantee a financial result. It simply makes the choice easier to see and follow through.",
      "settings": {
