    },
    {
      "id": "s011",
      "title": "Three questions",
      "text": "Try three questions before changing the habit. Do I notice and enjoy this purchase? Does it fit after essentials and my realistic savings or debt plan? Would I prefer the best alternative use of the money? There is no universal answer hiding in the coffee cup. Your priorities, your obligations, and your actual numbers supply the answer. Write them down instead of judging yourself.",
