    },
    {
      "id": "s012",
      "title": "A fair experiment",
      "text": "If you are unsure, run a small experiment rather than making a permanent promise. For two weeks, keep the coffees you genuinely look forward to and replace the automatic ones. Record what you actually spent, including the replacement. Notice whether the change makes your day worse, better, or simply different. Then decide whether the money released was worth the experience you gave up.",
