    {
      "id": "s013",
      "title": "When keeping it is reasonable",
      "text": "Keeping the coffee can be a deliberate decision too. If your essentials are covered, your plan is realistic, and this little ritual adds value, you do not need to defend every sip. Enjoy it on purpose. If the budget is under pressure, make a temporary adjustment with a clear reason. A changed plan is not a moral verdict on the person holding the cup.",
