    {
      "id": "s014",
      "title": "A practical first step",
      "text": "Here is a practical place to start today. Look at one week of actual transactions. Circle one purchase you value and one you would not miss. Estimate the difference you could genuinely keep, not the headline total. Choose where that difference will go. Then check again after another week. You are building a repeatable decision, not trying to win an argument with a spreadsheet.",
