    {
      "id": "s015",
      "title": "Close",
      "text": "So, is your daily coffee really the problem? Sometimes it is a useful place to make a change. Sometimes it is an affordable pleasure worth protecting. The aim is not to remove all enjoyment from today. It is to give both today and tomorrow a place in your plan. Check out the Money Leak Audit Workbook in the description. Educational only, not financial advice.",
